  "title": "Automation System – Library Services",
  "text": "Automation System – Library Services Back UoG Home Home About Us Vision and Mission Branch Libraries Library Services Library Sections Library Collections Library Rule and regulation Staff profile E-Resources Institutional Repository Digital Library NADLE NADRE Open Access Journals and Databases IPHC-E Resource Center Automation Systems Library Automation OPAC RFID System Campus Libraries CMHS Library Maraki Campus Library Atse Tewodros Campus Atse Fasil Campus Library Tseda Campus Library (+251) 58 114 12 32 info@uog.edu.et TV Radio Staff Profile Event Mail UoG Home Home About Us Vision and Mission Branch Libraries Library Services Library Sections Library Collections Library Rule and regulation Staff profile E-Resources Institutional Repository Digital Library NADLE NADRE Open Access Journals and Databases IPHC-E Resource Center Automation Systems Library Automation OPAC RFID System Campus Libraries CMHS Library Maraki Campus Library Atse Tewodros Campus Atse Fasil Campus Library Tseda Campus Library Automation System Home Automation System Library automation system handles the various functions of the University of Gondar library. It provides a complete solution to the library management. At the University of Gondar, library automation is based on RFID System. All library collections are tagged by RFID chip. Almost all sections of the library have automated. Features of library automation at the University of Gondar library Integration of all records of students It can manage the safety of the collections Manage the records systematically It can track any information online One can generate the reports Manage all information online Easy to maintain records It leads to fast book entry OPAC You can access all the record of the library through OPAC (10.139.5.18) Automation Systems RFID System Automation System OPAC Public and International Relations +251 581 14 1232 info@uog.edu.et Maraki Street, Gondar, Ethiopia 196 Important Links OPAC RFID systems Digital Library Institutional Repository Resources Student Information System (Internal) Research and Ethics Application System (REAMS) UoG Journals Student Application System Student Registration System Student Placement System (Internal) Research, TT and Community Service Portal Copyright © University of Gondar| All Rights Reserved.",
